This project implements the method described in "Sparks of Weight-Space
Programming" (Takehi, Teoh, Zhang, Khattab, 2026),
https://rikiyat.github.io/blog/weight-space-programming/. The paper's code,
logs and checkpoints are not redistributed here.

It builds on third-party work:

- NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), PyTorch (BSD-style), Hugging Face Transformers and
  safetensors (Apache-2.0).
- OpenAI and Anthropic Python SDKs (Apache-2.0 / MIT), used as optional
  LLM backends.
